scn 1
# Overtaking within one click (2026-11-15): a mixed selection marching as a block -- 16 slow 2x2 bodies (speed 1.15,
# an Aramon Archer's) in front, 16 fast 3x3 (2.9, an Aramon Knight's) behind -- sent with ONE right-click to a point
# 130 cells ahead over open ground. Asset-free.
name overtake-click-blob
ticks 5000
players 1
weapons off
map flat 128 200
type slow mover 2 2500 1 1.15
type fast mover 3 2500 1 2.9
group S 0 slow 16 rect 50 150 74 160
group F 0 fast 16 rect 48 162 76 178
at 5 move S,F 62 20
